    ("guest", "With keyframes on the volume, or a fade, or both. The listener should never notice it happening. They should just feel that they can always hear the words."),
    ("host", "What about sound effects? I feel like short form video is full of whooshes now."),
    ("guest", "Oh, the whoosh. The whoosh is the duct tape of modern editing. A cut feels abrupt? Whoosh. A title flies in? Whoosh. And honestly, used well, it works. It tells the ear that something moved."),
